  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding of Africa Component research</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Funding of Africa Component research is a component of Improved Rural Roads and Transport Services for Communities in Low Income Countries.  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;2,232,162. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Research/scientific institutions, Technological research and development, Transport policy and administrative management, Road transport.</narrative>
  </description>
